functio measured()
rem Typing: the cost of one keystroke, roadmap item 19.
rem Line 1 is one character short of a definition. Typing the `n`
rem opens a block nothing below closes, so every line under it
rem changes fold depth and the rescan runs to the end of the file.
rem block 1 -- a comment with the word function in it
function f1(a, b) local acc
  acc = 0
  for i = 1 to 2
    if a > b then
      acc = acc + left$("a string with endif in it", 1)
    endif
  next
  return acc
endfunction
